t,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">初创团队Genesis AI发布机器人基础模型GENE-26.5，实现单模型自主执行复杂任务</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI联合英伟达等巨头发布MRC协议，重塑大规模AI训练网络架构</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI宣布投入500亿美元提升AI算力资源以支撑模型训练与推理</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布Gemma4系列模型多Token预测起草器，推理速度提升至3倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/24419041183e297530bcace62dcd166f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式发布针对Gemma4系列模型的MTP（多Token预测）起草器，通过推测解码架构，在保持输出质量的前提下，将模型推理速度最高提升3倍。该技术通过将重型目标模型与轻量级起草器配对，利用闲置算力提前预测多个Token，并由主模型并行验证，有效缓解了显存带宽限制带来的推理瓶颈。实测数据显示，在Apple Silicon芯片环境下，Gemma 4 26B模型的本地运行速度提升约2.2倍（batch size为4至8）。此次更新旨在降低边缘设备能耗，使开发者能在个人电脑或消费级显卡上流畅运行复杂的离线编程助手及智能体工作流。随着推理成本与门槛的降低，Gemma4正推动AI应用从云端向个人计算终端普及，为即时聊天机器人及自动化工具提供更高效的部署方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯联合高校发布OpenSearch-VL：开源多模态深度搜索Agent全家桶方案</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/7c8d7004a3ed53cb550fff1f2846aa2a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯混元联合UCLA、香港中文大学发布OpenSearch-VL，这是一套旨在通过强化学习打造深度搜索Agent的开源全家桶方案。针对多模态模型难以进行多步推理的瓶颈，团队构建了包含3.6万条指令微调轨迹的SearchVL-SFT数据库及8000条强化学习数据库。该方案集成OCR、图像增强、网页及反向图像搜索等多元工具，使Agent具备“主动感知”与修复视觉输入的能力。核心创新点在于“多轮故障感知GRPO”训练算法，通过掩码技术与单边优势钳制，让模型从失败轨迹中学习有效搜索逻辑。实验显示，OpenSearch-VL在七项主流多模态深度搜索基准测试中平均性能提升超10%，部分任务表现比肩顶级闭源商业模型。目前，项目已全量开源代码、数据及模型权重，旨在为开发者提供可复现的底层框架，推动多模态智能体研究进入深水区。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">初创团队Genesis AI发布机器人基础模型GENE-26.5，实现单模型自主执行复杂任务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/499f9eb58e2e3a4e20cdccf85ef32ce0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">初创团队Genesis AI近日发布首个机器人基础模型GENE-26.5，该模型通过单一底层架构实现了对高难度、非结构化任务的自主处理。在最新演示中，搭载该模型的机器人无需人工干预，即可完成单手打蛋、解魔方、弹钢琴及切番茄等多种复杂动作。GENE-26.5的研发依托于团队自研的Genesis物理引擎，实现了从硬件设计、控制栈开发到模型训练的全链路闭环。该技术路径具备极高学习效率，复杂动作技能仅需不到一小时的专属数据即可完成训练。Genesis AI曾于2025年中旬获得1.05亿美元种子轮融资，创下行业纪录。团队计划近期公布首个全身通用机器人，旨在推动机器人技术从实验室走向更复杂的真实世界场景，实现类人的自主操作能力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI联合英伟达等巨头发布MRC协议，重塑大规模AI训练网络架构</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d7c9b66cdadb43eb0acbfe4eba475f7c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI联合AMD、博通、英特尔、微软及英伟达发布多路径可靠连接（MRC）协议，并通过开放计算项目（OCP）开源。该协议旨在解决大规模AI训练中的网络延迟与故障问题，通过多平面网络设计，将800Gb/s接口拆分为多个链路，仅需两层交换机即可支撑约13.1万块GPU集群，显著降低建设成本与能耗。MRC采用自适应数据包喷淋技术，将数据包分发至数百条路径并行传输，并利用SRv6源路由技术替代复杂的动态路由协议，将网络故障恢复时间从秒级压缩至微秒级，实现链路抖动下的“无感自愈”。目前，MRC协议已在英伟达GB200超级计算机及甲骨文云基础设施中投入应用，实测证明其能有效绕过故障点，确保训练任务不中断，标志着AI基础设施正向精细化架构转型。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI宣布投入500亿美元提升AI算力资源以支撑模型训练与推理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c837f4493d467314bec37c70ee75d9b2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI总裁Greg Brockman近日披露，公司计划在2026年投入500亿美元用于提升计算资源，以应对生成式AI从实验阶段转向大规模商业化带来的算力需求激增。该笔投资将覆盖模型训练、全球用户调用ChatGPT的推理成本以及更大规模模型的持续研发。对比2017年约3000万美元的算力支出，OpenAI的投入已增长数千倍。此外，OpenAI设定了长期目标，预计到2030年累计计算投入可能高达6000亿美元。这一举措标志着AI行业竞争重心正从算法能力转向对GPU集群及云计算基础设施的控制权。目前，微软、谷歌、亚马逊等科技巨头均在扩建数据中心并锁定GPU供应，行业已步入算力军备竞赛阶段，全球AI基础设施投资规模将持续攀升。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
